				"body": "Amber and orange are already available as complete eleven-step scales. Use their exact existing palette tokens rather than introducing duplicate aliases or one-off shades.",
				"section": "colors"
			}
		],
		"dos": [
			"Do use the existing orange-* and amber-* scales when warm hues are needed.",
